# QC: LakeCity (LC-MKT-POL-001 §1-§8; LC-GOV-SOP-002 §4)

## A. Machine-checkable
| ID | Rule | Check | Verdict |
|---|---|---|---|
| LC-01 | No Odoo routes / template IDs in customer copy | `/lakecity/` or `template_id` in text/links/alt | FIX |
| LC-02 | Planned ≠ built | status verbs near infrastructure nouns without phase wording | FLAG |
| LC-nums | Numbers need source + date | numbers (%, $, counts) in public copy without source/date | FIX (auto-FAIL) |
| LC-sec | No secrets/tokens | secrets/tokens in copy | BLOCK |
| LC-ids | No internal IDs in public copy | technical IDs, bot names, file paths, Odoo routes, template IDs in text/links/alt | FIX/BLOCK |
| LC-cust | No customer PII in public copy | customer names/stands/balances; personal remittance payees | BLOCK |
| LC-fee | No Tapestry fees / off-policy prices | Tapestry fees; prices not from LC-SAL-POL-002 | FIX |
| LC-pay | Payment proof instruction | payment copy must include "email your proof of payment to admin@lakecity.co.zw" | FIX |
| LC-lnk | Links work | broken links | FIX |

## B. Judgement
- "planned ≠ built" wording ("in the approved master plan, delivered in phases").
- Estimates labelled "estimate, dated <month year>, not guaranteed".
